]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]epic_launch_read_dismiss.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/epic_launch_read_dismiss.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-14l[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-14l/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rust store matches row-owned settlement notifications[/bold #D7AFFF]         [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]core-match[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core-match: teach the notification store's agent-keyed dismissal to [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]match host-owned settlement rows by exact (cl_name, raw_suffix), with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]parity tests that pin the exact-match requirement.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Read acknowledgment dismisses the settlement row[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]host-ack[dim] · [dim][/dim]after core-match[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]host-ack: ratchet the core revision pin, widen the TUI's cached-snapshot[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]predicate so acknowledged settlement rows leave the cache and the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]indicator with the completion row, and document the widened contract.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]An active settlement row keeps its agent row unread[/bold #D7AFFF]           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]unread-projection[dim] · [dim][/dim]after host-ack[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]unread-projection: project active row-owned settlement notifications [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]into agent row unread state so a settlement that arrives after the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]completion was read still has a read event to clear it.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-14l","llm_provider":"claude","model":"sonnet","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-14l.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-eb06a49299f7782ce6f5fcf165b2e584","started_at":"2026-09-20T20:58:44.199998+00:00","state":"completed"}],"schema_version":2,"structural_ancestors":["bbugyi200.apollo.sase-14l","bbugyi200.apollo.sase-14l.1","bbugyi200.apollo.sase-14l.2","bbugyi200.apollo.sase-14l.3","bbugyi200.apollo.sase-14l.land"]}
